# Belt-and-suspenders: living-workflow working state now lives OUT-OF-REPO under XDG
# (see the master's STATE SUBSTRATE — <xdg-state-base>/<clone-name>/<workflow-name>/). Kept as
# cheap safety against any stray in-repo .living-workflows/ write, which should no longer happen.
.living-workflows/

# Local private working area (untracked journals, assessments, scratch)
/private/
